OL,3,ASwedish party blocs tied after Sunday
OL,4,Avote, projections say
OL,5,
OL,6,FSweden's general election remains too
OL,7,Fclose to call, early results suggest.
OL,9,FWith 50% of the votes counted, the two
OL,10,Fmain blocs were separated by only
OL,11,F20,000 votes, Sweden public
OL,12,Fbroadvasteer SVT said.
OL,14,FExit polls had given the left-wing
OL,15,Fpolitical bloc led by Social Democrats
OL,16,Fleader Magdalena Andersson a small lead
OL,17,Fover the rival four-party coalition put
OL,18,Ftogether by current conservative Prime
OL,19,FMinister Ulf Kristersson.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
